        "rationale": "The agent covered all required elements: pulled the latest reading for Transformer 1 at MAIN, computed a health index (72.4, Good), enumerated failure modes, checked work orders (no filtration/regeneration found, so no masking caveat needed), and produced a ranked list with reasons and a resampling interval following the stated rule. The interpret_dga tool failed repeatedly ('LLM unavailable'); the agent transparently fell back to manually computed Rogers/IEC ratios (0-2-2 \u2192 T2), which is corrob",
