tch).\n\n**Resampling interval**\nCondition per the health index is \"Good\" and the top-ranked mode is thermal, not arcing \u2192 **annual oil sampling**. That said, given the active T2 thermal signature and pending OLTC inspection, treating this unit annually in practice would be imprudent; if your budget policy keys on the DGA fault class rather than the composite index, treat it as Fair \u2192 quarterly.\n\n**Work order history**\nOnly one work order exists for this unit in the last year: WO 1000051 (OLTC inspection, PdM, Priority 1, status WAPPR). **No oil filtration or regeneration was performed**, so no re-baseline sample is needed and the gas-based ranking is not understated by oil treatment.",
